# Release-signing material: the armored private key, its passphrase and the
# key-generation parameters. The *public* key is committed, at
# `docs/signing/cryptoric-agent-signing-key.asc`, because that is the one users
# verify against. A private key in git history is unrecoverable and permanent.
.signing/
